        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "Ai nkhuan e Guang daimei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ai nkhuan e guang daimei,",
            "Kandih rianra jingmei khou;",
            "Damloumei Salem namdai,",
            "Gaimei 5#^ ning thuk ge,",
            "Kandih rianramei le jingmei bamkhou bamsini,",
            "Jaujianlouna phungguangmei Puta ningtan makge.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Tingkau Eden than gaimei 5#^,",
            "Rianra rianriu mei mak pui bam;",
            "He tabui nung guangtang nicho?",
            "Nang tingsang Guang daimei –",
            "Supui ram gaimei.",
            "",
            "2. Naguang o kanloumeipu,",
            "Rihdai e kandih khou hei;",
            "Nang jei ruina kanloumeiGuai lung gei na kap be,",
            "Kandih khou hei rianra lou pui bam e kalvari,",
            "Houmumei guai guange nangta adoumei nun 5#^.",
            "",
            "3. He bui thang cho? Kanloumei,",
            "Zion luangbut gaimei 5#^;",
            "Pap guai 5#^ tithan diu khang,",
            "Jeih 5#^ luang kei lou the,",
            "Papguai manpui bame tingsang namdai gaimei khou,",
            "Kanloumei guai gaina bampui ram gaimei khou 5#^.",
            "",
            "4. Hei kandih hei man puni,",
            "Tikgun daimei guai hei ni;",
            "Kanloumeipu ruina khuam kariu nimei guai ta,",
            "Kamei jianmei nun rui tikgun daimei lapuni,",
            "Kamei njianloumei thuanku o, Hallelujah."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
